    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078030/extras/3cfd8e6edc724ad727cea5018af02f90.poster.avif?t=1753252500\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078030/extras/3cfd8e6edc724ad727cea5018af02f90.webm?t=1753252500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078030/extras/3cfd8e6edc724ad727cea5018af02f90.mp4?t=1753252500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>A Warbound is an incremental Strategy where you raise the dead, battle knights and wage war with fleets of advanced futuristic Drones as you battle across the eras in this strategic combat simulator. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your base, unlock new technology, destroy the enemy before they can level up. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078030/extras/f57fc9a49af9b433605559744149e241.poster.avif?t=1753252500\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078030/extras/f57fc9a49af9b433605559744149e241.webm?t=1753252500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078030/extras/f57fc9a49af9b433605559744149e241.mp4?t=1753252500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolve Through Time:</strong> Start with swords and shields and advance to lasers and drones as you adapt to shifting battlefronts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command &amp; Conquer:</strong> Strategically place defenses, upgrade your arsenal, and outmaneuver cunning foes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078030/extras/61d06265f191a779ff6ef88afd108c13.poster.avif?t=1753252500\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078030/extras/61d06265f191a779ff6ef88afd108c13.webm?t=1753252500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078030/extras/61d06265f191a779ff6ef88afd108c13.mp4?t=1753252500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Art Style:</strong> Vibrant cel-shaded visuals bring rich, evolving battlegrounds to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Action:</strong> Balance between tactical decision-making and the chaos of combat.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078030/extras/83c66c34ee958c188a6d602f5d8eccd7.poster.avif?t=1753252500\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078030/extras/83c66c34ee958c188a6d602f5d8eccd7.webm?t=1753252500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078030/extras/83c66c34ee958c188a6d602f5d8eccd7.mp4?t=1753252500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Upgrade your home base, Add turrets, capture emplacements to build your defenses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of adaptation and claim victory in an ever-changing battlefield. Whether you're defending crumbling ruins or harnessing futuristic power, every decision brings you closer to conquering the ages.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078030/extras/3cfd8e6edc724ad727cea5018af02f90.poster.avif?t=1753252500\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078030/extras/3cfd8e6edc724ad727cea5018af02f90.webm?t=1753252500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078030/extras/3cfd8e6edc724ad727cea5018af02f90.mp4?t=1753252500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>A Warbound is an incremental Strategy where you raise the dead, battle knights and wage war with fleets of advanced futuristic Drones as you battle across the eras in this strategic combat simulator. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your base, unlock new technology, destroy the enemy before they can level up. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078030/extras/f57fc9a49af9b433605559744149e241.poster.avif?t=1753252500\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078030/extras/f57fc9a49af9b433605559744149e241.webm?t=1753252500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078030/extras/f57fc9a49af9b433605559744149e241.mp4?t=1753252500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolve Through Time:</strong> Start with swords and shields and advance to lasers and drones as you adapt to shifting battlefronts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command &amp; Conquer:</strong> Strategically place defenses, upgrade your arsenal, and outmaneuver cunning foes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078030/extras/61d06265f191a779ff6ef88afd108c13.poster.avif?t=1753252500\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078030/extras/61d06265f191a779ff6ef88afd108c13.webm?t=1753252500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078030/extras/61d06265f191a779ff6ef88afd108c13.mp4?t=1753252500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Art Style:</strong> Vibrant cel-shaded visuals bring rich, evolving battlegrounds to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Action:</strong> Balance between tactical decision-making and the chaos of combat.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078030/extras/83c66c34ee958c188a6d602f5d8eccd7.poster.avif?t=1753252500\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078030/extras/83c66c34ee958c188a6d602f5d8eccd7.webm?t=1753252500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078030/extras/83c66c34ee958c188a6d602f5d8eccd7.mp4?t=1753252500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Upgrade your home base, Add turrets, capture emplacements to build your defenses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of adaptation and claim victory in an ever-changing battlefield. Whether you're defending crumbling ruins or harnessing futuristic power, every decision brings you closer to conquering the ages.</p>",
